        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Old Overton Club\n- Publications: sport magazine, publication with The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time\n- People: Daron Malakian\n- Topics: Best New Private Courses, heavy metal guitar rankings\n\nFacts:\n- In 1994, a sport magazine rated the Old Overton Club as one of the \"Best New Private Courses.\"\n- A different publication placed Daron Malakian 30th in its list titled The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.\n- The sport magazine has existed for ten years longer than the publication that ranked Daron Malakian 30th.",
