        "original_id": "a11f1a5e-c417-5f8e-86e7-c27326cfcdc8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Guitar World, Golf Digest\n- Companies: Condé Nast Publications, The New York Times Company\n- People: Daron Malakian\n- Places: Des Moines, Iowa\n- Organizations: Old Overton\n- Concepts: magazine rankings, golf course rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Golf Digest started in 1950.\n- Golf Digest was sold to The New York Times Company in 1969.\n- Guitar World has been published since July 1980 as a monthly music magazine devoted to guitarists.\n- Old Overton was rated by Golf Digest as one of the Best New Private Courses in 1994.\n- Golf Digest is a monthly golf magazine published by Condé Nast Publications in the United States.\n- Golf Digest is headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa.\n- Daron Malakian was placed 30th in Guitar World's list The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.\n- Golf Digest currently lists Old Overton as the third best golf course in its state.",
